ite-space: pre-wrap;margin-bottom: 12px;">The Protocol Symposium is the fla=
gship research gathering of the emerging field of Protocol Studies, hosted =
by the Protocol Institute (PI). This year's symposium will be held <b>Septe=
mber 21-25, fully online</b>, on the theme of <b><a href=3D"https://protoco=
